1
00:04:09,360 --> 00:04:11,800
In how to use psychological tests

2
00:04:11,800 --> 00:04:16,720
And how to create a fair recruitment process with the help of the tests.

3
00:04:22,160 --> 00:04:28,800
After the training you have quite a few choices of workplaces that you can apply for.

4
00:04:28,800 --> 00:04:32,800
It depends a little on what you feel you have become interested in.

5
00:04:32,800 --> 00:04:36,880
For example, you can work in primary care, at a health center.

6
00:04:36,880 --> 00:04:40,280
Where you might be the first contact with someone who has started to feel bad,

7
00:04:40,280 --> 00:04:45,600
Or that has a certain problem that they want to get help with.

8
00:04:45,600 --> 00:04:48,080
Then you can also work at a school for example.

9
00:04:48,080 --> 00:04:53,120
Where you work more preventively with staff and students to create a better school environment.

10
00:04:53,120 --> 00:04:56,360
- Then you can also work with recruitment processes,

11
00:04:56,360 --> 00:04:59,880
to develop recruitment processes.
